From 4b3811cd888624faa5b06ed31f17cf35157ecea2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jraphaelsst <joaoraphaelsst@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 11 May 2026 22:21:58 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] test(erp): seed tenancy/filter columns in 29 fixtures
 exposed by MockSupabaseClient predicate filtering
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Surfaced by MOCK-SELECT-PREDICATE-FIX (45be944): 29 ERP service tests across 13
files seeded rows without the columns production SELECTs filter on. Pre-fix the
.eq/.neq/.lt/.gte predicates were tracked-but-not-evaluated by the mock; once
SELECT obeys them, the missing columns silently strip rows and tests fail with
empty results, 404s, or off-by-N counts.

Fix shape, per-file:
- agenda_service: corretor_id + status (eq + neq)
- banco_service: extrato_id + conciliado (TestAutoConciliar pair)
- certidoes_service: tipo + org_id (TJSP cooldown helpers); tipo + status
  (schedule_tjsp_for_org); id (delayed-tjsp re-fetch); consulta_id (resultados)
- clientes_service: id (single-row toggle_archive)
- contratos_service: status + data_vencimento (mark_overdue)
- email_service: cliente_id (get_historico_cliente)
- impostos_service: redistribute 2+2 rows across pendente/parcial
- manutencao_service: status (in_) + data_previsao (mark_overdue)
- marketing_service: campanha_id (get_campaign_stats trio) + created_at:NOW
- metas_service: usuario_id (existing-metas dedup)
- recorrencia_service: status=ativo (contratos_locacao filter)
- relatorios_service: arquivado=False (conversao_funil filter)
- seguros_service: status + data_vencimento (check_vencidos)

Key lesson: PF's single-column tenancy fix doesn't generalize. ERP services use
varied filter shapes (corretor_id, extrato_id+conciliado, status+data_vencimento,
tipo+status+org_id, etc.) — scan ALL chain predicates per route before fixing.

No production code touched. All 29 in-scope tests pass.

Out of scope: 24 xml_feeds test failures + 940 collection errors all root-cause
to a single missing `defusedxml` dep (in requirements.txt but missing from the
runtime python3.11 env). Pre-existing infra gap, filed for separate fix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
